    "notes": "No amounts are given, all amounts are guesses (~, about 1 katori of each bean). The three beans must already be boiled (soaking and boiling time is not counted in the 10 minutes). Ingredients come from the speech: chickpeas, rajma, moong, curd, onion, tomato, coriander, salt, black pepper. Health claims in the speech are left out."
